{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.SigmaShellFromBetaChainDerivation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.SigmaShellFromBetaChainDerivation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuWeight"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.sigma_shell_staircase_vanishes_conventionD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.sigma_shell_staircase_vanishes_conventionD","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/sigma-shell-from-beta-chain-derivation.lean#L81-L93","doc":"**The staircase σ_shell expression vanishes under convention D.**\n\nOver any field `R`, for `q` with `q² + 1 ≠ 0`, any Young diagram `μ`\nwith a non-empty third row, and any `C`, `χ`, `t`:\n`C · y_μ(q, z_D) · χ / t = 0`, where `z_D = q³/(q²+1)` and `y_μ` is the\nOcneanu weight. Every staircase partition of `3·A_magic` with\n`A_magic ≥ 2` has a third row, so this is the scope-(b) exclusion of the\nclosed form recorded in `conj:sigma-shell-from-beta-chain-derivation`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellFromBetaChainDerivation.identity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellFromBetaChainDerivation.identity","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/sigma-shell-from-beta-chain-derivation.lean#L76-L76","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellFromBetaChainDerivation.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellFromBetaChainDerivation.mk","kind":"ctor","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/sigma-shell-from-beta-chain-derivation.lean#L75-L75","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellFromBetaChainDerivation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellFromBetaChainDerivation","kind":"class","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/sigma-shell-from-beta-chain-derivation.lean#L62-L78","doc":"**The closed-form extraction (conjecture carrier; no instance).**\n\nAsserts the corrected categorical identity from\n`docs/audits/sigma-shell-categorical-identification.md`:\n\n  `y_target(A_magic)\n     = C_{λ_shell}(q_0) · y_{λ_shell}(q_0) · |χ^{λ_shell}(β_K)|\n       / |tr_M(β_K)|`\n\nThe class wraps the conjectural identification of `λ_shell`\nwith the staircase partition of `3·A_magic`; the field states the equation pointwise on\n`data : SigmaShellAtMagic`. Under convention D the identity forces\n`y_target = 0` at every magic staircase (see the module header). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:sigma-shell-from-beta-chain-derivation","label":"conj:sigma-shell-from-beta-chain-derivation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/sigma-shell-from-beta-chain-derivation.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellAtMagic.y_target","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellAtMagic.y_target","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/sigma-shell-from-beta-chain-derivation.lean#L60-L60","doc":"Extracted σ_shell magnitude. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellAtMagic.abs_tr_M","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellAtMagic.abs_tr_M","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/sigma-shell-from-beta-chain-derivation.lean#L58-L58","doc":"`|tr_M(β_K)|` at q_0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellAtMagic.abs_chi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellAtMagic.abs_chi","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/sigma-shell-from-beta-chain-derivation.lean#L56-L56","doc":"`|χ^{λ_shell}(β_K)|` at q_0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellAtMagic.y_lambda","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellAtMagic.y_lambda","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/sigma-shell-from-beta-chain-derivation.lean#L54-L54","doc":"Jones-Markov central coefficient `y_{λ_shell}(q_0)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellAtMagic.C_lambda","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellAtMagic.C_lambda","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/sigma-shell-from-beta-chain-derivation.lean#L52-L52","doc":"Wedderburn coefficient at the staircase partition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellAtMagic.A_magic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellAtMagic.A_magic","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/sigma-shell-from-beta-chain-derivation.lean#L50-L50","doc":"Magic anchor (one of {2, 8, 20, 28, 50, 82, 126}). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellAtMagic.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellAtMagic.mk","kind":"ctor","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/sigma-shell-from-beta-chain-derivation.lean#L48-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellAtMagic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SigmaShellAtMagic","kind":"structure","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/sigma-shell-from-beta-chain-derivation.lean#L41-L60","doc":"**Per-magic-anchor σ_shell data tuple.**\n\nEncodes the inputs and output of the corrected categorical\nclosed-form: the Wedderburn coefficient `C_{λ_shell}(q_0)`,\nthe central weight `y_{λ_shell}(q_0)`, the absolute character\n`|χ^{λ_shell}(β_K)|`, the absolute Markov trace `|tr_M(β_K)|`,\nand the extracted shell magnitude `y_target(A_magic)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}